---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo evaluators publish])

    Compile{WASM compiles and validates?}
    Version{Evaluator version exists?}
    Hash{Evaluator hash exists?}

    Persist[Insert evaluator WASM and metadata]

    Success([Success response])

    CompileFail([Compilation or validation error])
    VersionFail([Evaluator version conflict])
    HashFail([Duplicate evaluator code conflict])

    Start --> Compile

    Compile -- No --> CompileFail
    Compile -- Yes --> Version

    Version -- Yes --> VersionFail
    Version -- No --> Hash

    Hash -- Yes --> HashFail
    Hash -- No --> Persist

    Persist --> Success